    "description": {
      "en": "This is the guaranteed minimum daily ARE unemployment insurance benefit amount, set to 31.97 EUR/day (value as of 30 June 2025). It is used in bunct_fr/ArithOp and bunct_fr/Max (parameter LowLim in both) to floor the computed benefit at this minimum level. The policy documentation directly confirms a minimum ARE daily amount of 31.97 EUR for 2025."
